      "en": "But Noah found favor in the LORD’s eyes.",
      "ko": "그러나 노아는 여호와께 은혜를 입었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a838d3587a984d11f30a731b3531f0b4d05cb55086edfed9d98fd89ffbb1a62c",
      "translation_text_hash": "782608bc88c3be0c3bff399293b215578fb5b719b520546185148eb7d546768b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러나 노아는 여호와께 은혜를 입었더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "782608bc88c3be0c3bff399293b215578fb5b719b520546185148eb7d546768b"
