        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "This is the history of the generations of Noah: Noah was a righteous man, blameless among the people of his time. Noah walked with God.",
      "ko": "노아의 사적은 이러하니라 노아는 의인이요 당세에 완전한 자라 그가 하나님과 동행하였으며",
      "source_text_hash": "fbb604f7924b32646660fe4e66c0eb4ca7ea9ef729a24c17f6dabae427bc1e75",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e2e1a40c54a31e8bc2975cc01a1de6bdf133d2b7c1a70169ef96c38ff675e64",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
