      "en": "Noah became the father of three sons: Shem, Ham, and Japheth.",
      "ko": "그가 세 아들을 낳았으니 셈과 함과 야벳이라",
      "source_text_hash": "f335980a9b08f6d1a10de58cc92382503206a390495967ddfee893ebd393d522",
      "translation_text_hash": "702b7108cbd17ea619a64584c831cdeceb92fb6d5741118a58d689a1e9d4c0fe",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
