        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "God saw the earth, and saw that it was corrupt, for all flesh had corrupted their way on the earth.",
      "ko": "하나님이 보신즉 땅이 패괴하였으니 이는 땅에서 모든 혈육 있는 자의 행위가 패괴함이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "30438f642059ade131553a5a7d402f49376eeb28cd74ce9b1f9bba9a86231de2",
      "translation_text_hash": "61e9efcf247ed115b51e45a0e482ee803418525bf5301cecf413df6d5b9b6a6b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
